Now I have a complete picture of the current agents tab. Let me design the compact horizontal layout.

---

## Agents Tab Redesign - Compact Card Layout

### Current State Analysis

**What exists now (per card ~150px+ tall):**
- Avatar (40x40px emoji circle)
- Agent name + status dot
- Title text
- Model badge
- Task list area (100px max)
- Two buttons: Prompt dropdown + Config

**Problems identified:**
1. Cards are 280px wide × ~150px tall - take too much space
2. Task list per card is redundant (Tasks tab exists)
3. "Prompt" dropdown unclear purpose
4. Config button rarely used, prominent placement
5. Model shows "gemini-2.0-flash-lite" - hardcoded default, not actual backend

---

### Redesigned Layout

#### Compact Card Spec

| Element | Size | Content |
|---------|------|---------|
| Card height | 24px | Fixed, single row |
| Card width | auto (min 120px) | Content-fit |
| Container | horizontal scroll | Overflow-x: auto |

#### Card Structure (left-to-right)

```
[●] [emoji] AgentName [▼]
```

| Component | Pixel Width | Purpose |
|-----------|-------------|---------|
| Status dot | 8px | idle=gray, working=green pulse, rate-limited=red |
| Gap | 4px | |
| Emoji | 16px | Role identifier |
| Gap | 6px | |
| Name | auto | Agent name text, 12px font |
| Dropdown caret | 16px | Shows on hover, click opens menu |

#### Interaction: Click/Hover Menu

Clicking card or caret opens dropdown:
```
┌─────────────────┐
│ ✓ Check in      │  ← Prompt action
│   Resume task   │  ← Prompt action
│   Custom...     │  ← Opens input
│ ─────────────── │
│ ⚙ Config        │  ← Opens modal
│ 📋 View tasks   │  ← Scrolls to agent's tasks in Tasks tab
└─────────────────┘
```

---

### CSS Spec

```css
.agents-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: hidden;
    align-items: center;
    height: 40px;  /* 24px card + 16px padding */
    background: #1a1a2e;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
}

.agent-chip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    height: 24px;
    padding: 0 8px 0 6px;
    background: #16213e;
    border-radius: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 12px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--agent-color);
    transition: background 0.15s;
}

.agent-chip:hover {
    background: #1e2d50;
}

.agent-chip .status-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.agent-chip .emoji {
    font-size: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.agent-chip .name {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #eee;
}

.agent-chip .caret {
    opacity: 0;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #888;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
}

.agent-chip:hover .caret {
    opacity: 1;
}
```

---

### Removed Elements

| Element | Reason |
|---------|--------|
| Avatar circle (40px) | Redundant with emoji, wastes space |
| Title text | Rarely read, clutter |
| Model badge | Move to config modal only |
| Tasks list | Duplicate of Tasks tab |
| Visible buttons | Replaced with dropdown menu |

---

### Config Modal Fix

Current bug: Shows "gemini-2.0-flash-lite" hardcoded in line 1815.

**Fix:** Modal should read from `info.model` which comes from the roles API. If API returns actual backend, display correctly. If API doesn't include model, show "default" instead of hardcoded Gemini string.

```js
document.getElementById('configModel').value = info.model || 'default';
```

---

### Wireframe (ASCII)

```
┌─ Agents ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ [●👔 BOSS ▼] [●🎨 Designer ▼] [○💻 Programmer ▼] [○✍️ Writer ▼] ... │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
            ↓ (click)
      ┌─────────────────┐
      │ Check in        │
      │ Resume task     │
      │ Custom...       │
      │ ─────────────── │
      │ ⚙ Config        │
      │ 📋 View tasks   │
      └─────────────────┘
```

---

### Success Criteria

- [ ] All agents visible without scrolling (typical 6 agents fit in 800px)
- [ ] Card height exactly 24px
- [ ] Status dot shows real-time working/idle/rate-limited
- [ ] Click opens action menu
- [ ] Config modal shows actual model from API, not hardcoded value
- [ ] No duplicate task information (removed from cards)

## Agents Tab - Stats-First Compact Cards (T051)

### Design Direction Change

**Previous focus:** Agent access/controls (dropdowns, prompts, config)
**New focus:** Agent performance visibility (stats at a glance)

---

### Compact Stats Card Spec

| Element | Size | Content |
|---------|------|---------|
| Card height | 24px | Fixed |
| Card width | ~180px | Fixed for alignment |
| Container | horizontal scroll | overflow-x: auto |

---

### Card Structure (left-to-right)

```
[●] [👔] BOSS │ 12.4k │ 7 │ 2h
     ↑         ↑       ↑   ↑
   emoji     tokens  tasks uptime
```

| Component | Width | Content |
|-----------|-------|---------|
| Status dot | 8px | working=green pulse, idle=gray, error=red |
| Emoji | 16px | Role icon |
| Name | 60px max | Truncate with ellipsis |
| Divider | 1px | Subtle vertical line |
| Tokens | 40px | "12.4k" format (thousands) |
| Tasks | 24px | Completed count |
| Uptime | 32px | "2h" or "45m" or "3d" |

---

### Stats Definitions

| Stat | Source | Format | Tooltip |
|------|--------|--------|---------|
| Tokens | Session total input+output | <1000: "847", ≥1000: "12.4k", ≥1M: "1.2M" | "12,432 tokens this session" |
| Tasks | Completed task count | Integer | "7 tasks completed" |
| Uptime | Time since first activity | <1h: "45m", <24h: "2h", ≥24h: "3d" | "Active since 2:30 PM" |

---

### Visual Hierarchy

```
High contrast (white):     Agent name
Medium contrast (#aaa):    Stats numbers  
Low contrast (#666):       Dividers, labels on hover
Accent color:              Status dot, left border
```

---

### CSS Spec

```css
.agent-stat-chip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 24px;
    padding: 0 10px 0 6px;
    background: #16213e;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--agent-color);
    font-size: 11px;
    gap: 6px;
    min-width: 160px;
}

.agent-stat-chip .status-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
}

.agent-stat-chip .name {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    max-width: 60px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.agent-stat-chip .divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 14px;
    background: #333;
    margin: 0 4px;
}

.agent-stat-chip .stat {
    color: #aaa;
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
}

.agent-stat-chip .stat-tokens { width: 36px; text-align: right; }
.agent-stat-chip .stat-tasks { width: 20px; text-align: right; }
.agent-stat-chip .stat-uptime { width: 28px; text-align: right; }
```

---

### Interaction (Minimal)

- **Hover:** Show tooltip with full stat details
- **Click:** Single action - opens config modal (rare use case)
- **No dropdown menu** - stats display is primary purpose

---

### Wireframe

```
┌─ Agents ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ [●👔 BOSS    │ 12.4k│ 7│2h] [●🎨 Designer│ 8.2k│ 3│1h] [○💻 Prog...│ 0│ 0│-] │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                    ↑ hover
         ┌────────────────────────┐
         │ 12,432 tokens          │
         │ 7 tasks completed      │
         │ Active since 2:30 PM   │
         └────────────────────────┘
```

---

### Data Requirements

Programmer needs these values per agent:

```js
{
    name: "BOSS",
    emoji: "👔",
    status: "working" | "idle" | "error",
    color: "#4CAF50",
    tokens: 12432,        // integer, total session
    tasksCompleted: 7,    // integer
    firstActiveTime: Date // or null if never active
}
```

---

### Removed from T049 Design

| Element | Why Removed |
|---------|-------------|
| Dropdown menu | Stats display, not control panel |
| "Check in" / "Resume" prompts | Not needed for monitoring |
| "View tasks" link | User has Tasks tab |
| Dropdown caret | No dropdown |

---

### Success Criteria

- [ ] All 3 stats visible per card without hover
- [ ] Card height exactly 24px
- [ ] Tokens formatted with k/M suffix
- [ ] Uptime shows human-readable duration
- [ ] Status dot reflects real agent state
- [ ] 6 agents fit in 800px width without scroll

